Hi,
I was just wondering whether it's possible to peform amova in dartR with different levels, such as individuals within populations within groups/regions?

I tried to conduct this is poppr but i get extremely different results if I use ade4 versus the pegas implementation in poppr...

So, I am not sure which one to trust..

It would be great if there was a similar option in dartR that I could test...?

Thanks!
Gabriella

